      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En aquellos tiempos, barcos mercantes de China llegaban seguido a las costas de Bali.",
          "en": "In those days, merchant ships from China often came to the coasts of Bali."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un mercader tenía una hija llamada Kang Cing Wie.",
          "en": "One merchant had a daughter named Kang Cing Wie."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando el rey la vio, se enamoró al instante.",
          "en": "When the king saw her, he fell in love at once."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y decidió que ella sería su reina.",
          "en": "And he decided that she would be his queen."
        }
