        {
          "es": "Junto al lago, se le apareció una mujer hermosa.",
          "en": "By the lake, a beautiful woman appeared before him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era Dewi Danu, la diosa del lago. Pero vino con forma de mujer.",
          "en": "It was Dewi Danu, the goddess of the lake. But she came in the form of a woman."
        },
        {
          "es": "El rey quedó hechizado. Y no le dijo que ya tenía esposa.",
          "en": "The king fell under her spell. And he did not tell her that he already had a wife."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se casaron, y con el tiempo la diosa le dio un hijo.",
          "en": "They married, and in time the goddess gave him a son."
        }
