        },
        {
          "es": "Estos muñecos gigantes se llaman Barong Landung. La gente todavía los pasea por las calles en las fiestas.",
          "en": "These giant puppets are called Barong Landung. People still carry them through the streets at festivals."
        },
        {
          "es": "La cara oscura es el rey, dice la gente. La cara pálida, con rasgos chinos, es Kang Cing Wie.",
          "en": "The dark face is the king, people say. The pale face, with Chinese features, is Kang Cing Wie."
